    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "We begin with Aesop’s classic fable of the The Tortoise and the Hare but continue the story which finds them 10 years down the road, now with children of their own and exploring modern day distractions.&nbsp; Smart phones and video games create a new landscape of lost connections to life experie"
