      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "America's Got Talent runners-up to bring this fabled story featuring Tortoise Jr. and Lil' Hare competing in a new kind of race where their adventures lead them into unexpected territory. Dazzling visuals and creative use of music from classical to pop, bring this tale into a new, brilliant light. F"
