        "@value": "Santa’s helpers are putting the final touches on presents as a young bird named Max and his family head south for the winter. Max gets blown off course during a snowstorm and ends up alone and lost at the North Pole. He meets friendly caroling worms, dancing poinsettias, Nutcracker soldiers, and oth"
