    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The story begins with Aesop’s classic fable of The Tortoise and The Hare where the “slow and steady” Tortoise defeats the nimble but overconfident Hare.  For those who ever wondered what happened after the race, Lightwire Theater continues the story which finds the two opponents ten years down the r"
