        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Lightwire Theater brings a classic tale to the modern stage in an unforgettable theatrical experience.&nbsp; Lined with electroluminescent wire, the beloved story of  The Ugly Duckling &nbsp;plays out on stage through a cutting-edge blend of puppetry, technology and dance.  With dazzling vis"
