        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Brighten your holidays with Lightwire Theater’s  A Very Electric Christmas !&nbsp;Audiences of all ages will treasure this magical and captivating tale of family, friendship and hope set to timeless holiday hits.  In this wonderful story, Santa’s helpers are putting the final touches on presents"
